Third-party software
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

nvModern incorporates the components below. Each remains under its own licence;
all of them are compatible with distribution under GPL-3.0-or-later. Each
package's own licence text ships with it (in `node_modules/<package>/` for web
dependencies, and in the Swift package checkout for native ones). Versions are
as resolved by `bun.lock` and `Package.resolved`.

Why the project is GPL: `uniorg` and `uniorg-parse` (the Org-mode parser) are
licensed GPL-3.0-or-later and are bundled into the app, so the combined work
is distributed under the GPL.

