Fonts

  The web bundle includes the font files that ship with KaTeX (MIT / SIL OFL
  1.1) and Excalidraw (Excalifont, Virgil, Cascadia Code, Assistant, Liberation
  Sans, ComicShanns and others, mostly SIL OFL 1.1). Their licences travel with
  the upstream packages.

Patches

  `NVModern/WebEditor/patches/` contains a small patch to @codemirror/view
  (MIT, Copyright (C) Marijn Haverbeke and others), applied at install time.

Built-in themes

  `NVModern/BuiltinThemes/catppuccin.css` uses the Catppuccin palette
  (MIT, Copyright (c) Catppuccin) and `nord.css` uses the Nord palette
  (MIT, Copyright (c) Sven Greb / Arctic Ice Studio).

Development-only

  The Racket Arbor kernel (`ArborKernel/`) depends at run time on the Racket
  `datalog` package (Apache-2.0 / MIT). Racket itself is not bundled.
